@startuml
actor Submitter
actor Reviewer
actor "Current recipient" as Recipient
participant "Expense use case" as UC
participant "Authorization" as Auth
participant "Allocation domain service" as Alloc
database "Transactional store\n(product not selected)" as Store
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as Outbox
participant "Journal" as Journal

Submitter -> UC : submit expense
UC -> Auth : check submitter, payer, participants
Auth --> UC : authorized / current members
UC -> Alloc : validate and calculate shares
Alloc --> UC : exact allocations
UC -> Store : save PENDING expense + allocations\n+ notification outbox records
Store --> UC : committed
UC --> Submitter : pending expense ID

Reviewer -> UC : decide at approval level
UC -> Auth : reviewer eligible? not submitter?
Auth --> UC : allowed
UC -> Store : conditional decision on PENDING subject
alt rejection at any required level
  Store -> Store : mark REJECTED; no journal posting
else not all levels complete
  Store -> Store : record decision; remain PENDING
else final required approval
  Store -> Journal : atomically finalize and append entries\nunique source posting key
  Journal --> Store : posted once
end
Store --> UC : result or stale/duplicate conflict
UC --> Reviewer : final state
Outbox -> Store : read committed notification work
Outbox --> Recipient : delivery status tracked; details reauthorized on read
@enduml
